      "html": "<!-- COMPONENT: sections/full-width-image | FULL-WIDTH IMAGE (LIVE HTML, OPTIONAL LINK)\nTOKENS:\n  https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0657/8723/2489/files/WithLoveCard.jpg?v=1771723389  — full-width image URL (600px wide; any height — the image's natural ratio is kept). Klaviyo/R2 hosted.\n  A hand-tied seasonal bouquet, photographed in soft morning light.   — alt text describing the image (required for accessibility).\n  https://figandbloom.com/collections/bouquets   — optional href wrapping the image. Leave \"\" for no link.\nRULES:\n  - LIVE HTML (html_only) — NOT sliced — so the image keeps its own click-through link and an\n    animated GIF keeps animating. Listed in assembly.html_only_components.\n  - Full 600px content width, edge to edge. Any aspect ratio: the image's natural height is kept.\n  - No text, no button — a single full-width image. For a fixed 4:5 photo hero use\n    heroes/hero-image-only; for a short 180px lifestyle pause use dividers/divider-image.\n-->\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0;line-height:0;font-size:0;\">\n<a href=\"https://figandbloom.com/collections/bouquets\" style=\"display:block;line-height:0;text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img class=\"fimg\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0657/8723/2489/files/WithLoveCard.jpg?v=1771723389\" alt=\"A hand-tied seasonal bouquet, photographed in soft morning light.\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;\">\n</a>\n</td></tr>\n"
